# Keeps the Cloud Run build fast and the image small — this repo's build
# context is the monorepo root (see apps/api/Dockerfile's own comment for
# why), so without this file Docker would upload every node_modules,
# build artifact, and the whole apps/web frontend on every build.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github
apps/web
storage-data
*.md
!apps/api/**/*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.production.example
